4.Re-run plan to see the exact diff 

Run terraform plan again to see Terraform detect the change inside your local module:

PowerShell

terraform plan

Key Difference: Registry Modules vs. Local Modules
Registry Modules (source = "terraform-aws-modules/vpc/aws"): 
Code is fetched from the web and pinned with version = "x.y.z".

Local Modules (source = "./modules/aws-s3-bucket"): 
Code lives on your machine. You don't use version = ... 
because changes made inside the local files update immediately.